abstract: >-
  Research materials and software developed within the Building Legacy project
  to support the documentation, evaluation, and reuse of building components.
  The repository includes materials supporting the derivation and
  operationalisation of a reusable component data model, component data sheets,
  a representative individual component data sheet template, and the source
  code of a Revit Add-in for semi-automated acquisition of component
  information from BIM models.

